Dear Ms Fadenruh,

Please find yesterday's status letter attached. The amount remains pending at=
 our desk. We have not sent a credit confirmation to the beneficiary institut=
ion. A screenshot saying received is not a confirmation of release.

Please include the company secretary's complete statement when responding. We=
 have seen a small diagram with 30 and 25 beside two names, but it does not t=
ell us whether they are separate holdings or whether one line includes anothe=
r. The register should make that clear. We also need to know whether a transf=
er mentioned by the director has actually taken place.

There is no instruction for the EUR order in our system. Please do not combin=
e the two references in a single payment enquiry, as that makes it difficult =
to track the documents.

Kind regards,
Kunibert Glockenflaum
